11. `src/obs.rs` `CONFIG_KEYS` 5 → 7 (`default_model`, `default_effort`), so neither is counted under unknown-keys;
    `schemas/config.v1.json` gains `default_model` (`{"type": "string", "pattern": "^[a-z][a-z0-9.-]{0,63}$"}`) and
    `default_effort` (`{"enum": [the five words]}`).

- **Older binaries:** an older wrapper or `viola list` over a home a newer start wrote counts the `launch` line under
  `skipped.unknown_kinds` and reads the snapshot's unknown field whole (architecture · decision/mixed-version-tolerance);
  this session's pinned product (built from `f274938f`, `inputs#I1`) reads only its own home.
